# tank_drive: straight-line handling. Board, then from rest hold Up 12 s
# (accel), release 4 s (coast), hold Down 6 s (brake / reverse). Bursts every
# 86 ms (2 game frames) for the analyzer: background shift = speed, lane-line
# spacing = screen scale (speed zoom).
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80

17000 shot start
+50 tap enter 70
+4500 shot boarded
+100 down up
+0 burst accel 140 86
+12000 up up
+0 burst coast 47 86
+4000 down down
+0 burst reverse 70 86
+6000 up down
+300 shot end
+100 quit
